
# CUPDATE — Complete Website Redesign & Development

## 1. Project Overview

Project Name: CupDate
Website: https://cupdate.in

Build a modern, premium, responsive dating and social connection
platform for people who want to meet new people, make genuine
connections, find friendship and enjoy coffee dates.

Main Concept:
"Meet Someone. Share a Coffee. Create a Connection."

Target Audience:
- Singles in Himachal Pradesh
- People looking for genuine relationships
- People looking for friendship
- People interested in coffee dates
- Local people looking to meet nearby
- Users interested in online chat and video calling

Brand Positioning:
- Genuine profiles
- No fake profiles
- No adult content
- Safe and respectful environment
- Real connections over random swiping

